  "description": "Elisha Lionet, the young owner of an old pawnshop.\n\nIn her first life, she was deceived by a distant relative who said he would take care of her sick grandfather, he had all of her grandfather’s property taken away, and did and her Grand father was met with a miserable death.\n\nAnd in the second life; given to her as a miracle…\n\n“Grandpa, the pawnshop, my life too—I’ll never let them take them again.” she swore to protect.\n\nReturned from death, she resolved to protect her grandfather and the pawnshop she inherited from him.\n\n“Does this pawnshop deal in people too?”\n\nCustomers who suddenly demand that she sell them,\n\n“Who gave you permission to do business here?”\n\nCustomers who threaten her with thuggish intimidation,\n\n“H-how did you know this is a holy relic?!”\n\nCustomers who were obviously trying to sell stolen goods…\n\nCan Elisha overcome the interference of these rather strange customers(?)\n\nand safely protect her grandfather and the pawnshop?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68660440), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B3%B5%EB%85%80%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%80-%EC%A7%84%EC%A7%9C%EB%A7%8C-%EC%B7%A8%EA%B8%89%ED%95%A9%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/4778)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/196943)",
